  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_005) and avgpool aggregation (config_006) provide strong performance. This experiment tests combining these with image data (resnet50) in a multimodal setup, isolating the impact of adding image modality while keeping RNA and aggregation methods consistent. It directly addresses whether multimodal components can improve upon the current RNA-only best, balancing exploration of image data's value with exploitation of proven RNA components."
